# Golden run of Brakes.dll's brakes on the ЭП20 (EP20-063 started "on"),
# docs/brakes-dll-replacement.md step 1. Its DLL works from the second cab
# (367 key 206 at 3). The 130 valve (switch 200) runs VI .. I: VI 0, V 1,
# VЭ 2, IV 3, III 4, II 5, I 6. Then the independent valve (224, switch
# 201) through its states, and the ЭПК key (207) on and off. RTS's air.
#
#   openrts-train-check <RTS root> --dll mdd_EP20-063 mdd_EP20-063 --start on
#       --script tests/data/golden/ep20_brakes.script --record ep20_brakes.tsv
# 3 kV DC: started "on" its circuit is DC; under 25 kV AC it drops its
# main switch and its compressors stop.
1    voltage 3000
# Charged in II, then a service step: V 3 s, III, IV, II.
40   switch 200 1
43   switch 200 4
63   switch 200 3
83   switch 200 5
# VЭ 3 s, IV, II.
120  switch 200 2
123  switch 200 3
133  switch 200 5
# Emergency: VI 10 s, I 5 s, II.
160  switch 200 0
170  switch 200 6
175  switch 200 5
# The independent valve's states, 5 s each, then back.
210  switch 201 1
215  switch 201 2
220  switch 201 3
225  switch 201 4
230  switch 201 5
235  switch 201 6
240  switch 201 0
# The ЭПК key on, off.
260  switch 207 1
280  switch 207 0
300  expect alive == 1
